# 開發版與舊版存檔不上傳
Whisper_開發版_整理版/
archive_old_*/
backup_*/

# 安裝版裡不需上傳的內容
**/models/*.pt
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.deps_ready

# macOS 系統檔
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
._*
**/._*

# 打包壓縮檔
*.zip

# Native app build artifacts, models and audio never belong in source commits
*.pkg
*.exe
*.dmg
*.app/
**/model.bin
packaging/**/build-local/
packaging/**/dist/
packaging/**/resources/
